 "files": {},
 "strandsDrawing": {
  "alt": "Seven layers read top to bottom: dashboard, tools, app (the Robot factory), sim beside policies, drivers beside mesh, registry, core. A module imports only from layers below its own; scripts/check_import_layers.py grades the rule from the source with ast, and every deferred upward edge is written in its roster, a ratchet that only shrinks."
 }
}